/div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Yalahar <a href=\"#/wiki/Foreigner%20Quarter\">Foreigner Quarter</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Trade%20Quarter\">Trade Quarter</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Maze%20of%20Lost%20Souls\">Maze of Lost Souls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ulderek%27s%20Rock\">Orc Fort</a> (unreachable), <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate\">Hellgate</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Shadowthorn\">Shadowthorn</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a> elf caves, <a href=\"#/wiki/Elvenbane\">Elvenbane</a>, north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tElves are fierce warriors, they will fight to the death.<br/><br/>An elf attacks in melee range. An elf never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tJust attack them. Their melee is very easy to block, the only danger are the arrows which are rarely used.<br/>\nThey have low defense but be careful, they may be accompanied by <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Scout\">Elf Scouts</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Arcanist\">Elf Arcanists</a>, which are more dangerous.\n</p>